step 1 "@connect rambler"
rng 51872 4ba9daca
step 2 "Rambler"
out rambler "\n\r\n\rTHIS IS A MUD BASED ON.....\n\r\n\r                                ROM Version 2.4 beta\n\r\n\r               Original DikuMUD by Hans Staerfeldt, Katja Nyboe,\n\r               Tom Madsen, Michael Seifert, and Sebastian Hammer\n\r               Based on MERC 2.1 code by Hatchet, Furey, and Kahn\n\r               ROM 2.4 copyright (c) 1993-1998 Russ Taylor\n\r\n\rBy what name do you wish to be known? Password: \xff\xfb\x01"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 3 "psswrd"
out rambler "\n\r\xff\xfc\x01* You are responsible for knowing the rules (type 'rules').  Ignorance of \n\r  the rules is no excuse.\n\r* Important commands: help, commands, news, notes\n\r* Use the delete command to erase unwanted characters\n\r  \n\r[Hit Return to continue]\n\r"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 4 "@return"
out rambler "\n\rWelcome to ROM 2.4.  Please don't feed the mobiles!\n\rThe Temple Of Mota\n\r  You are in the southern end of the temple hall in the Temple of Mota.\n\rThe temple has been constructed from giant marble blocks, eternal in\n\rappearance, and most of the walls are covered by ancient wall paintings\n\rpicturing gods, giants and peasants.\n\r   Large steps lead down through the grand temple gate, descending the huge\n\rmound upon which the temple is built and ends on the temple square below.\n\r   Equally large steps lead UP through a small door into the ENTRANCE to MUD \n\rSCHOOL.  (type 'up' to go to MUD SCHOOL.)  A small plaque is on this wall.\n\r\n\r[Exits: north south up]\n\rHassan is here, waiting to dispense some justice.\n\r\nNum          Name Unread Description\n\r==== ============ ====== =============================\n\r( 1)      General [   0] General discussion\n\r( 2)        Ideas [   0] Suggestion for improvement\n\r( 3)     Announce [   0] Announcements from Immortals\n\r( 4)         Bugs [   0] Typos, bugs, errors\n\r( 5)     Personal [   0] Personal messages\n\r\n\rYou current board is General.\n\rYou can both read and write on this board.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 5 "gs"
out rambler "You are Rambler the Recruit, level 2, 17 years old (0 hours).\n\rRace: human  Sex: male  Class: warrior\n\rYou have 29/29 hit, 102/102 mana, 106/106 movement.\n\rYou have 1 practices and 1 training sessions.\n\rYou are carrying 5/47 items with weight 14/230 pounds.\n\rStr: 19(19)  Int: 13(13)  Wis: 13(13)  Dex: 13(13)  Con: 13(13)\n\rYou have scored 2088 exp, and have 0 gold and 0 silver coins.\n\rYou need 912 exp to level.\n\rWimpy set to 0 hit points.\n\rYou are standing.\n\rYou are defenseless against piercing.\n\rYou are defenseless against bashing.\n\rYou are defenseless against slashing.\n\rYou are defenseless against magic.\n\rYou are saintly.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 6 "gl"
out rambler "The Temple Of Mota\n\r  You are in the southern end of the temple hall in the Temple of Mota.\n\rThe temple has been constructed from giant marble blocks, eternal in\n\rappearance, and most of the walls are covered by ancient wall paintings\n\rpicturing gods, giants and peasants.\n\r   Large steps lead down through the grand temple gate, descending the huge\n\rmound upon which the temple is built and ends on the temple square below.\n\r   Equally large steps lead UP through a small door into the ENTRANCE to MUD \n\rSCHOOL.  (type 'up' to go to MUD SCHOOL.)  A small plaque is on this wall.\n\r\n\r[Exits: north south up]\n\rHassan is here, waiting to dispense some justice.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51895 7f5599b5
step 7 "gl hassan"
out rambler "Big. Very big.\n\rStupid. Very stupid.\n\r\n\rHassan, the guardian of  the Temple of Mota, towers over you.  He's over 12 \n\rfeet tall, every inch of it muscle. It would be a Bad Thing to commit a crime\n\rin his presence.\n\rHassan is in excellent condition.\n\r\n\rHassan is using:\n\r<wielded>           (Humming) Hassan's scimitar\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
rng 51896 5ed8996e
step 8 "gl  plaque"
out rambler "This entire world has been integrated, modified, debugged, and enhanced by\n\rHatchet, Kahn, and Furey of MERC Industries to be run by any MERC Mud.\n\r1992 December 17\n\rROM enhancements by Alander.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
